WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:26.720
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:41.240 --> 01:42.280
What's the situation there?

01:43.120 --> 01:44.000
Duanwu,

01:44.680 --> 01:46.040
apart from the Master

01:46.120 --> 01:47.800
and his two guards,

01:47.880 --> 01:48.720
there are three others on the upper deck.

01:48.800 --> 01:50.080
Two of them are older.

01:50.160 --> 01:51.400
One is Steward Zhao,

01:51.480 --> 01:53.120
and the other is Assistant Pang.

01:53.200 --> 01:55.680
And the third one is a woman,
Accountant Wei.

01:55.760 --> 01:57.600
They say Assistant Pang
always sides with Overseer Cao.

01:58.200 --> 02:00.880
That means Assistant Pang

02:00.960 --> 02:03.680
is Overseer Cao's backup
on the upper deck.

02:03.760 --> 02:04.800
Also,

02:04.880 --> 02:07.480
most of those on the middle deck
are warriors,

02:07.560 --> 02:08.960
led by a man called Kang Ju.

02:11.240 --> 02:12.200
Kang Ju?

02:13.160 --> 02:15.240
I remember him. What about the lower deck?

02:15.760 --> 02:19.480
On the lower deck,
Loud is strong and eats a lot.

02:19.560 --> 02:21.600
Dear Xiu is very nimble,

02:22.120 --> 02:23.960
usually handling the finer work.

02:24.480 --> 02:26.480
And there's Dear Hu.

02:26.560 --> 02:28.560
She's knowledgeable,

02:28.640 --> 02:30.720
always telling us what not to do.

02:30.800 --> 02:32.560
And you know what?

02:32.640 --> 02:35.080
Dear Hu even gave me a treat.

02:38.960 --> 02:39.800
Quick, hide it!

02:42.480 --> 02:43.680
Dear Hu! Dear Xiu!

02:43.760 --> 02:44.600
-Hello, Dear Hu!
-Thank you.

02:44.680 --> 02:45.520
-Hello, Dear Xiu!
-No problem at all.

02:46.600 --> 02:49.080
-Here, let me help you.
-No need.

02:49.160 --> 02:50.480
-I'll carry it for you.
-No need.

02:50.560 --> 02:51.600
-It's fine.
-I'll help, too.

02:51.680 --> 02:53.480
We're new here,
so it's natural to do more.

02:53.560 --> 02:55.160
-Let me take it.
-We still need

02:55.240 --> 02:56.080
to deliver the waste material.

02:56.160 --> 02:57.840
This is waste material?

02:57.920 --> 03:00.360
If my third uncle saw this,
he'd surely say we're striking it rich!

03:01.080 --> 03:02.560
Our convoy handles a lot of jewelry,

03:02.640 --> 03:03.960
so naturally, there's a lot of waste.

03:04.480 --> 03:06.360
How much does this waste sell for per jin?

03:06.440 --> 03:08.760
I heard from Overseer Cao,
about 18 cash per jin.

03:09.520 --> 03:10.680
-Right.
-We're off to get busy.

03:10.760 --> 03:11.600
Alright, thank you.

03:13.600 --> 03:14.640
Mr. Cao!

03:15.240 --> 03:17.080
Duanwu, Shrimp, this is Mr. Cao.

03:17.840 --> 03:19.720
So, you're the two newcomers, huh?

03:19.800 --> 03:22.720
I'm Duanwu, the new one here.
This is my younger partner, Shrimp.

03:23.320 --> 03:25.520
-Greetings, Mr. Cao.
-Please look out for us.

03:25.600 --> 03:27.720
"Look out" might be too much.
Just do as you're told.

03:27.800 --> 03:30.320
Mr. Cao, we'll head out
to deliver the waste now.

03:30.400 --> 03:31.240
-Go ahead.
-Sure.

03:34.880 --> 03:36.120
You're Shrimp, right?

03:36.200 --> 03:38.880
-Here.
-No, please. You can keep it.

03:39.880 --> 03:40.880
How cute.

03:41.760 --> 03:44.560
Listen up, everyone! It's payday!

03:44.640 --> 03:46.640
-Alright!
-Wages are being handed out!

03:46.720 --> 03:47.680
Come on. Let's go!

03:47.760 --> 03:50.160
You all are pretty lucky.

03:50.240 --> 03:52.480
The Master added 100 cash
for each of you this time.

03:53.000 --> 03:54.240
Thanks, Mr. Cao!

03:56.960 --> 03:58.920
Why do even the servants get wages?

03:59.440 --> 04:00.920
Stop there.

04:01.920 --> 04:03.160
Come over. What are you afraid of?

04:03.840 --> 04:05.920
Last time, we had you polish
those jewelry boxes,

04:06.440 --> 04:08.720
and now Assistant Pang pays you for them.

04:10.680 --> 04:13.040
Afraid I'm going to eat you? Off you go.

04:15.480 --> 04:16.760
Thanks, Mr. Cao.

04:18.240 --> 04:19.600
Thanks, Mr. Cao.

04:19.680 --> 04:22.240
Everyone got your pay?
Now, get back to work.

04:22.800 --> 04:24.120
-Let's go. Get to work.
-Mr. Cao,

04:24.200 --> 04:26.600
that pair of shoes
you got for me last time is great.

04:26.680 --> 04:27.840
Could you get me another pair?

04:27.920 --> 04:29.240
Well…

04:29.320 --> 04:31.000
-And some cured meat.
-Huh?

04:32.000 --> 04:32.920
Cured meat.

04:34.040 --> 04:34.880
He wants cured meat.

04:36.080 --> 04:39.440
Mr. Cao, next time we dock,
could you get us some rice wine?

04:39.960 --> 04:42.800
Alright. You always need something,

04:42.880 --> 04:45.520
but only I don't mind helping you out.

04:45.600 --> 04:46.920
Here's the deal.

04:47.000 --> 04:49.880
Cured meat on shore
costs 110 cash per strip.

04:49.960 --> 04:51.600
I'll charge you 100 cash.

04:51.680 --> 04:54.360
Shoes are 200 cash per pair,
and rice wine is 300 cash per jar.

04:54.440 --> 04:55.760
If you want to buy--

04:58.720 --> 04:59.560
Here.

05:00.560 --> 05:01.760
Thanks, Mr. Cao!

05:01.840 --> 05:02.840
-Thanks, Mr. Cao.
-Thanks, Mr. Cao.

05:02.920 --> 05:03.920
Get back to work now.

05:07.000 --> 05:09.640
-Shrimp, let's go.
-Duanwu!

05:10.600 --> 05:13.360
-What's wrong?
-Overseer Cao is so rotten.

05:14.160 --> 05:16.240
He's taking more than half from everyone.

05:17.640 --> 05:18.680
What do you mean?

05:19.200 --> 05:21.640
Duanwu, you haven't been outside,
so you don't know.

05:21.720 --> 05:24.960
Cured meat outside
costs only 50 cash per jin.

05:25.040 --> 05:27.440
And cloth shoes cost
just 100 cash per pair.

05:28.560 --> 05:30.400
I thought he was kind,

05:30.920 --> 05:33.040
but he's actually like this.

05:33.840 --> 05:36.360
-No way. I have to tell everyone.
-Come back here.

05:37.960 --> 05:40.720
We're new here
and haven't even left the ship.

05:40.800 --> 05:41.800
How would they believe us?

05:41.880 --> 05:44.720
-No way.
-Listen to me, Shrimp.

05:44.800 --> 05:46.240
We can't rush this.

05:52.000 --> 05:55.160
Did you see it just now?
That waste material…

05:56.400 --> 05:57.600
It's actually valuable.

05:57.680 --> 06:00.600
Some can be used as medicine,

06:00.680 --> 06:02.720
and some can be melted and reshaped.

06:02.800 --> 06:05.600
So, if that's the case,
do you know how to?

06:05.680 --> 06:07.880
Of course!
My third uncle does this kind of work.

06:08.600 --> 06:11.440
We could consider
dealing in waste material.

06:12.640 --> 06:13.880
We could!

06:16.160 --> 06:18.840
But we're on this ship

06:18.920 --> 06:20.400
and can't get off.

06:21.640 --> 06:23.400
Who would we sell it to here?

06:25.080 --> 06:26.920
Naturally, we can't sell it on this ship.

06:29.320 --> 06:31.160
So, we have to find a way to get off.

06:35.600 --> 06:37.640
Cui Ding took his own life.
Before he died, he confessed

06:37.720 --> 06:38.960
and said your younger sister
is in Shaozhou.

06:45.520 --> 06:46.360
Wonderful.

06:46.920 --> 06:50.160
Once we're done in Guangzhou,
we'll go straight to Shaozhou.

06:50.240 --> 06:51.600
Alright.

06:51.680 --> 06:53.200
Has Zhang Jinran arrived in Guangzhou?

06:53.280 --> 06:55.880
At their pace,
he should be half a day behind us.

06:56.520 --> 06:59.800
Then Zhang Jinran
will have to accept this big gift.

07:00.320 --> 07:02.840
-What if he traces it back to you?
-He won't.

07:02.920 --> 07:04.960
The ones who want
Cui Ding dead the most now

07:05.480 --> 07:06.320
are the Cui family.

07:06.400 --> 07:07.720
You want Zhang Jinran to believe

07:07.800 --> 07:09.200
that the Cui family killed to silence him,

07:09.280 --> 07:10.600
linking the pearl farm to the Cui family?

07:11.320 --> 07:12.840
Destroying the Cui's Pearl Farm

07:13.360 --> 07:15.480
isn't enough to bring the Cui family down.

07:16.000 --> 07:18.320
With their wealth, they could soon
gather enough tribute pearls.

07:18.920 --> 07:20.720
But if Zhang Jinran follows up on this,

07:20.800 --> 07:22.760
proving the Cui family
sold tribute pearls secretly

07:22.840 --> 07:24.120
and deceived the Emperor,

07:24.640 --> 07:27.120
then it's a crime punishable
by total extermination.

07:27.760 --> 07:31.280
Once they arrive in Guangzhou,
they'll receive this generous gift.

07:34.640 --> 07:36.360
Master, you called for me?

07:36.440 --> 07:38.840
I'm planning to host a poetry gathering
in Guangzhou.

07:38.920 --> 07:41.800
The prize is ten taels of pearls.

07:43.080 --> 07:44.720
Ten taels of pearls?

07:45.600 --> 07:47.480
Master, isn't that

07:47.560 --> 07:48.400
a bit extravagant?

07:49.040 --> 07:51.400
Special Envoy of Treasures
Xu Nanying, Cui Shijiu,

07:51.480 --> 07:52.360
and Zhang Jinran,

07:52.960 --> 07:55.680
together, are they not worth
ten taels of pearls?

07:56.440 --> 07:57.720
Yes, Master.

08:02.200 --> 08:04.800
Peng Wu is Xu Nanying's man,

08:05.400 --> 08:07.040
and Xu Nanying serves Prince Tan.

08:07.680 --> 08:10.240
Cui Shijiu will definitely
turn to Xu Nanying for help.

08:11.040 --> 08:14.120
You'll involve Zhang Jinran,
hoping he sees this, right?

08:14.200 --> 08:15.840
After all, he's his senior brother.

08:15.920 --> 08:19.240
Aren't you afraid
Zhang Jinran might hesitate?

08:23.280 --> 08:24.520
He won't.

08:39.159 --> 08:41.840
-Sister Hu.
-Duanwu, still awake?

08:41.919 --> 08:43.760
Yeah, I can't sleep.

08:44.280 --> 08:45.560
I'll help you with it.

08:46.520 --> 08:47.840
I'm going up to clean the upper deck.

08:47.920 --> 08:50.160
We're only permitted there at midnight.

08:50.840 --> 08:51.880
The upper deck?

08:53.800 --> 08:54.840
I'll go for you.

08:56.240 --> 08:58.120
You're new here,
and there's much you don't know.

08:59.200 --> 09:01.480
-Don't anger the Master.
-I know. I will…

09:02.000 --> 09:04.960
I'll be careful.
I promise I'll be careful.

09:06.520 --> 09:07.680
When I'm not here,

09:07.760 --> 09:10.200
please look after my younger partner,
Shrimp.

09:11.280 --> 09:12.120
Thank you.

09:12.200 --> 09:13.920
Alright…

09:14.000 --> 09:15.280
Now, go get some rest.

09:15.360 --> 09:17.560
Remember, be very gentle,

09:17.640 --> 09:19.560
and don't miss a single spot.

09:22.960 --> 09:24.160
Be very gentle.

09:25.280 --> 09:28.440
-Go rest.
-Off you go.

09:40.040 --> 09:41.520
Three million cash…

09:43.440 --> 09:45.200
As a servant,
that's impossible in a lifetime.

09:47.000 --> 09:48.280
As a seller,

09:49.080 --> 09:50.160
how much would I have to sell?

09:51.760 --> 09:55.160
I must find a way off this ship. But how…

09:56.080 --> 09:57.800
do I convince him?

10:05.240 --> 10:07.760
Remember, be very gentle.

10:10.640 --> 10:11.680
Oh, here goes nothing!

10:27.720 --> 10:30.160
Duanwu, lower deck servant,
reporting to the Master.

10:30.240 --> 10:32.640
-Has no one taught you the rules?
-They have.

10:33.280 --> 10:35.400
Clean the upper deck, no dust allowed.

10:35.480 --> 10:37.520
Seems they didn't teach you well enough.

10:38.160 --> 10:39.600
Tomorrow, I'll sell them all off.

10:39.680 --> 10:40.800
Master.

10:42.280 --> 10:43.160
It's my fault.

10:43.240 --> 10:46.000
I asked to come up here.
It has nothing to do with them.

10:48.080 --> 10:49.280
So, you accept punishment for you mistake?

10:49.360 --> 10:50.360
I accept.

10:51.440 --> 10:52.880
But Master, may I ask?

10:53.760 --> 10:55.360
Could I have a chance to leave the ship?

10:59.120 --> 11:01.000
The three million needed
to buy back my pearl

11:01.800 --> 11:03.720
is more than a servant could earn
in a lifetime.

11:03.800 --> 11:06.520
So, I want to leave
to see if there's a way.

11:08.720 --> 11:11.360
Fine. We'll arrive in Guangzhou tomorrow.

11:11.880 --> 11:12.880
Before sunrise,

11:13.400 --> 11:16.560
clean the entire ship by yourself,

11:16.640 --> 11:18.400
and I'll let you leave the ship.

11:19.760 --> 11:21.960
Deal.

11:32.800 --> 11:34.480
Not a single word more.

11:57.320 --> 12:00.160
YAN

12:28.440 --> 12:33.880
FUSHU PORT

12:36.920 --> 12:40.040
Anchor and dock!

13:09.080 --> 13:10.040
Duanwu!

13:18.440 --> 13:20.400
Duanwu, why are you sleeping here?

13:20.480 --> 13:21.920
What's wrong?

13:24.040 --> 13:25.440
We've arrived in Guangzhou!

13:27.240 --> 13:28.320
Shrimp,

13:28.400 --> 13:29.760
today, we can get off the ship.

13:29.840 --> 13:31.080
Really?

13:31.160 --> 13:33.600
In a bit, we'll go down
and look for opportunities,

13:33.680 --> 13:35.440
-see if there's anything we can do.
-Alright.

13:35.960 --> 13:38.840
Once we find a chance,
we can earn some money.

13:39.400 --> 13:41.880
With money,
we can buy all sorts of treats.

13:43.480 --> 13:45.560
Alright. When we've earned enough,

13:46.080 --> 13:48.800
-I'll get you whatever you want.
-Alright.

13:49.760 --> 13:50.920
-All servants,
-Gather our things.

13:51.000 --> 13:52.360
off the ship!

13:53.520 --> 13:54.360
We're getting off the ship!

13:54.440 --> 13:55.280
Let's go!

13:55.800 --> 13:56.920
-Finally, we're getting off the ship!
-Exactly.

13:57.000 --> 13:58.600
-Let's go!
-Hurry!

14:01.080 --> 14:02.640
All servants?

14:04.520 --> 14:06.240
Duanwu, did you get everyone

14:06.320 --> 14:08.320
the chance to get off?

14:10.000 --> 14:10.920
Not quite.

14:22.280 --> 14:24.160
-Sir.
-What's going on?

14:24.240 --> 14:25.680
They found Cui Ding's body on the shore.

14:25.760 --> 14:27.200
He's dead?

14:29.720 --> 14:30.560
When?

14:30.640 --> 14:32.200
When I was filing a report
at the government office,

14:32.280 --> 14:33.560
I heard the body
has already arrived there.

14:33.640 --> 14:34.600
The coroner examined him and said

14:34.680 --> 14:37.560
Cui Ding endured severe torture
and bit his tongue to end his life.

14:43.640 --> 14:44.600
The tribute pearl case

14:45.200 --> 14:46.520
couldn't have been done by Cui Ding.

14:47.960 --> 14:49.120
Behind this…

14:50.760 --> 14:51.880
apart from the Cui family…

14:52.640 --> 14:53.520
Come in!

14:55.600 --> 14:57.280
Sir, you have a letter.

15:00.480 --> 15:01.920
A pearl poetry gathering?

15:04.320 --> 15:05.360
Yan Zijing!

15:10.280 --> 15:11.160
PEARL POETRY GATHERING
A MEETING OF MINDS

15:11.240 --> 15:12.120
THE WINNER'S PRIZE
TEN TAELS OF PEARLS

15:12.200 --> 15:13.840
BEST REGARDS, YAN ZIJING
MERCHANT FROM THE STATE OF KANG

15:15.080 --> 15:17.160
-Yan Zijing…
-I'll take you somewhere.

15:18.360 --> 15:21.360
If their pearls can't compare to this one,

15:21.920 --> 15:23.960
I'll gladly pay five million cash for it.

15:24.600 --> 15:25.520
This gold willow leaf

15:25.600 --> 15:27.240
isn't something ordinary people can own.

15:30.160 --> 15:31.200
Apologies from me.

15:32.280 --> 15:33.120
Who sent this?

15:33.200 --> 15:35.360
When the fire broke out,
we scrambled to leave.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.720
Someone bumped into me,

15:36.800 --> 15:39.200
and this ledger appeared in my bag.

15:40.160 --> 15:42.440
Every detail seems tied to him.

15:43.560 --> 15:45.120
What's his real intention?

15:45.840 --> 15:48.680
This Pearl Poetry Gathering…
Could it be a trap?

15:50.080 --> 15:51.520
Should we go or not?

16:00.560 --> 16:01.400
Go.

16:02.720 --> 16:05.520
With such meticulous planning,
we can't miss out on it.

16:10.400 --> 16:11.880
BEST REGARDS, YAN ZIJING
MERCHANT FROM THE STATE OF KANG

16:29.880 --> 16:31.000
Sir, you're here!

16:32.360 --> 16:35.160
These are gifts sent in advance
by the merchant guild.

16:35.240 --> 16:37.200
I've been helping to arrange it.

16:42.160 --> 16:43.360
By the way, sir,

16:44.040 --> 16:45.200
look at this.

16:47.440 --> 16:49.520
Didn't I say no meetings?

16:50.200 --> 16:51.680
Whose invitation is this?

16:51.760 --> 16:55.160
Originally,
I wouldn't dare disturb you, sir,

16:55.240 --> 16:58.000
but this is truly something remarkable.

16:58.080 --> 17:01.360
Then tell me, how remarkable is it?

17:01.440 --> 17:04.640
The merchant Yan Zijing
is offering ten taels of pearls

17:04.720 --> 17:06.240
to host a pearl poetry gathering

17:06.319 --> 17:08.839
in front
of the Temple of the South Sea God.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.280
He's also sent a grand gift,

17:11.800 --> 17:14.960
hoping you would honor the event.

17:29.080 --> 17:30.960
Merchants always have countless tricks

17:31.480 --> 17:33.200
for chasing profit.

17:33.280 --> 17:37.080
But in the end, they're still so vulgar.

17:37.880 --> 17:41.240
Sir, what you say is true.

17:42.920 --> 17:46.040
However, this Yan Zijing
is no ordinary person.

17:46.640 --> 17:49.800
He claims all renowned scholars
come from Chang'an,

17:50.320 --> 17:52.800
and the best of Chang'an is Scholar Xu.

17:54.280 --> 17:55.120
This time,

17:55.200 --> 17:59.040
he's invited many renowned scholars
from Lingnan, saying that

17:59.120 --> 18:03.000
they must complete the final line
of your unfinished poem

18:03.520 --> 18:04.360
to join the gathering.

18:05.120 --> 18:06.320
My unfinished poem?

18:11.640 --> 18:14.480
"A burst of sacred light pierces
the heavens,

18:14.560 --> 18:18.800
The divine dragon spreads rain
across the mountains."

18:20.240 --> 18:24.840
Regarding this poem,
I recall I recited it offhand

18:24.920 --> 18:26.680
before the temple.

18:26.760 --> 18:29.800
You may not know this, but your verse

18:29.880 --> 18:32.840
has already spread
through every street in Lingnan,

18:32.920 --> 18:35.840
becoming a popular tale.

18:36.480 --> 18:38.040
Who knew

18:38.600 --> 18:40.400
a casual verse from me

18:40.480 --> 18:42.960
would turn into a legend!

18:43.680 --> 18:45.600
Let's go have a look.

18:45.680 --> 18:47.960
Although merchants can be crude
in their pursuits,

18:48.560 --> 18:51.200
this one seems to have some refinement.

18:51.720 --> 18:54.600
Alright, let's go see.

18:59.560 --> 19:01.240
I'll take my leave.

19:31.880 --> 19:32.720
It's here.

19:33.480 --> 19:34.320
Watch your step.

19:34.400 --> 19:35.240
Just place it here.

19:35.880 --> 19:36.880
Careful.

19:38.520 --> 19:39.880
-Careful.
-Be extra careful.

19:40.760 --> 19:43.320
Duanwu, are your legs still hurting?

19:43.400 --> 19:44.920
You've cleaned the ship all night

19:45.000 --> 19:46.240
and worked all day.

19:46.920 --> 19:48.240
Go and rest a bit.

19:48.760 --> 19:49.960
Don't worry. I'm fine.

19:50.040 --> 19:51.520
-Alright, that's okay.
-Alright.

19:52.320 --> 19:53.800
It's done over here.

19:55.480 --> 19:56.520
My dear Duanwu,

19:57.040 --> 19:58.920
this kind of silk is very precious.

19:59.000 --> 20:01.880
We must handle it with care.
If it gets damaged,

20:01.960 --> 20:03.040
I'll be the one to get scolded for it.

20:03.120 --> 20:06.920
Got it, Mr. Cao.
I was just checking if it was secure.

20:07.000 --> 20:08.480
Pick up the pace! Everyone, be careful.

20:08.560 --> 20:10.400
-Okay?
-I know. Mr. Cao, don't worry.

20:11.400 --> 20:14.360
Keep your spirits up and pick up the pace!

20:14.440 --> 20:16.960
-I'll show you how.
-It took us so long to get here.

20:17.040 --> 20:18.280
The Master, seriously,

20:18.360 --> 20:21.280
promised we could get off,
but we ended up working instead.

20:23.960 --> 20:26.400
How is it? Just as you wished, right?

20:26.480 --> 20:27.960
Just as I wished.

20:29.440 --> 20:30.920
The view off the ship is nice indeed.

20:32.000 --> 20:34.040
Why aren't you causing trouble today?

20:34.120 --> 20:35.800
When did I ever cause trouble?

20:36.400 --> 20:38.600
Who would dare in front of the Master?

20:39.960 --> 20:41.800
Aren't you satisfied
now that you're off the ship?

20:43.360 --> 20:46.160
No, I'm dissatisfied with myself.

20:46.840 --> 20:48.840
Next time, I'll make sure
to speak more clearly.

20:48.920 --> 20:52.160
Speaking clearly won't help.
I can change the rules anytime I want.

20:56.080 --> 20:57.400
Still no change.

20:59.560 --> 21:01.520
The Master is just too much…

21:01.600 --> 21:03.080
Enough. It's fine.

21:03.800 --> 21:05.640
-Stop dawdling. Hurry up!
-Dear Hu.

21:07.000 --> 21:07.960
Let me do it.

21:08.560 --> 21:09.720
Be careful!

21:10.880 --> 21:14.120
Master Shijiu, are we too early?

21:14.880 --> 21:15.960
No matter.

21:18.240 --> 21:21.840
Chupu Silk…
Yan Zijing is quite extravagant.

21:22.360 --> 21:23.680
Extravagant, indeed.

21:23.760 --> 21:25.440
He even used a chest of fake gold bullion

21:25.520 --> 21:26.480
to trick the pearl farm out of the pearls.

21:26.560 --> 21:27.520
Causing all this fuss,

21:27.600 --> 21:29.920
using our Cui family's pearls as prizes
for a poetry gathering.

21:30.000 --> 21:31.200
-He's truly crossed the line.
-Master Shijiu,

21:32.560 --> 21:35.360
that's the lowly slave
who set the Pearl Tower on fire, Duanwu!

21:35.440 --> 21:38.680
I'm better now. Look. Isn't that right?

21:39.760 --> 21:41.040
I'd best not show my face.

21:42.000 --> 21:43.280
I'm exhausted.

21:43.880 --> 21:45.200
-Let's take a break.
-Take a break.

21:46.960 --> 21:50.280
Duanwu, it's nice to get off the ship
and walk around…

21:51.200 --> 21:53.440
-Duanwu.
-Let's go.

21:53.520 --> 21:54.760
Alright.

21:56.040 --> 21:57.800
This is Master Cui Shijiu.

21:57.880 --> 22:00.560
You little runaway slave,
why aren't you kneeling?

22:00.640 --> 22:02.200
I'm not a slave of the Cui family.

22:04.200 --> 22:06.080
I belong to the Yan trading convoy.

22:07.040 --> 22:10.440
My household registration
is recorded at the government office.

22:11.160 --> 22:12.000
Let's go.

22:12.760 --> 22:14.840
If Master Shijiu says you are a slave,
then you are!

22:14.920 --> 22:16.160
You wretched slave, today, I'll…

22:17.600 --> 22:18.640
-Get lost!
-Shrimp!

22:21.880 --> 22:23.160
A registered household?

22:23.240 --> 22:25.480
But what does that change?

22:26.000 --> 22:28.040
It doesn't erase your lowly origins!

22:28.680 --> 22:30.520
You forced people to dive for pearls,

22:31.720 --> 22:33.440
and it was never my choice.

22:35.080 --> 22:36.880
You tortured the innocent to death,

22:38.640 --> 22:41.280
and every Cui pearl is stained with blood.

22:43.320 --> 22:44.560
My life…

22:46.040 --> 22:47.560
I fought for it myself,

22:48.800 --> 22:51.040
not given by your Cui family!

22:51.120 --> 22:51.960
-Let go!
-How dare you

22:52.040 --> 22:54.040
-treat Master Shijiu like this!
-Let go!

22:57.320 --> 22:58.560
You dare touch me?

22:58.640 --> 23:01.080
I'll end you!

23:05.640 --> 23:06.480
Stop!

23:07.080 --> 23:08.640
-Master!
-Master!

23:11.000 --> 23:12.040
Just you wait.

23:14.720 --> 23:15.560
Duanwu!

23:21.160 --> 23:22.000
What happened?

23:22.080 --> 23:25.640
Master, I am now part
of the Yan trading convoy.

23:26.760 --> 23:27.680
During the Yan poetry gathering,

23:28.560 --> 23:31.040
the Cui family struck at Yan's people.

23:32.120 --> 23:33.280
How should this be handled?

23:34.000 --> 23:36.320
Why show such disrespect toward my people?

23:36.400 --> 23:37.760
A lowly slave

23:37.840 --> 23:39.720
daring to stand above a guest…

23:39.800 --> 23:42.040
Is this how Yan entertains?

23:42.120 --> 23:44.800
She's merely a servant in the Yan convoy.

23:44.880 --> 23:48.480
Why such anger, Lady Shijiu?

23:53.080 --> 23:54.800
Oh, now I see.

23:55.440 --> 23:57.080
No wonder a mere pearl diver

23:57.160 --> 23:59.800
had the nerve
to turn my pearl farm upside down.

23:59.880 --> 24:02.800
Someone must be helping her
from the outside.

24:05.480 --> 24:08.320
I really don't understand
what you're saying.

24:11.480 --> 24:13.520
First, you used fake gold bullion

24:13.600 --> 24:17.000
to trick my pearl farm
out of priceless pearls.

24:17.080 --> 24:19.320
Then, to destroy the evidence,

24:20.040 --> 24:21.840
you had this wretched slave

24:21.920 --> 24:23.200
set the Pearl Tower ablaze.

24:23.280 --> 24:26.480
Afterward, you calmly absorbed her
into your convoy.

24:27.080 --> 24:28.760
Such a clever scheme, Master Yan!

24:28.840 --> 24:30.800
I didn't set the Pearl Tower on fire!

24:30.880 --> 24:33.000
Whether it was you or not,

24:33.520 --> 24:36.040
-I know in my heart--
-Special Envoy Xu has arrived!

24:43.880 --> 24:44.720
Greetings, Special Envoy Xu.

24:44.800 --> 24:47.280
Special Envoy Xu,
this person is named Duanwu.

24:47.960 --> 24:49.320
She's the one who burned Cui's Pearl Farm.

24:50.200 --> 24:51.960
Not only did she kill and burn,
but she also fled to escape justice.

24:52.040 --> 24:54.640
I ask Special Envoy Xu to detain her.
Questioning will reveal the truth.

24:54.720 --> 24:57.160
-She set the pearl farm ablaze?
-Yes.

24:58.120 --> 25:00.800
Arson and murder are grave crimes.

25:00.880 --> 25:03.360
If it's true, we can't take this lightly.

25:03.440 --> 25:06.680
Guards, seize her!
I'll handle the matter personally.

25:06.760 --> 25:08.480
-Take her away!
-Wait.

25:09.600 --> 25:10.520
Senior Brother,

25:11.320 --> 25:14.040
today is the Pearl Poetry Gathering.
Don't make it look like a trial.

25:14.120 --> 25:18.520
But someone in front of me
accused her of murder and arson.

25:19.440 --> 25:22.760
If I ignore it,
wouldn't that be defying the court

25:22.840 --> 25:24.200
and abusing my power?

25:24.280 --> 25:26.360
And you still need to handle it yourself?

25:26.440 --> 25:27.280
Rest assured, Junior Brother.

25:28.040 --> 25:30.480
If there's any injustice,

25:31.080 --> 25:32.960
I'll certainly ensure
she's treated fairly.

25:34.360 --> 25:36.280
As the Special Envoy of Treasures,

25:37.120 --> 25:40.960
questioning the Cui's Pearl Farm case
in front of everyone,

25:41.760 --> 25:44.080
wouldn't it raise concerns
of overstepping your authority?

25:45.720 --> 25:48.920
I think it's best
left to the Hepu officials.

25:49.440 --> 25:50.480
Special Envoy Xu,

25:51.040 --> 25:54.880
as the Special Envoy of Treasures
overseeing all pearl tributes,

25:54.960 --> 25:56.720
the Cui's Pearl Farm
is under your jurisdiction.

25:57.320 --> 25:58.360
Please, make the decision.

25:58.440 --> 26:01.600
Your pearls fall under his authority,

26:02.120 --> 26:03.120
the person does not.

26:04.640 --> 26:06.840
-Might I ask what you mean by that?
-Hey.

26:06.920 --> 26:09.120
Junior Brother, you speak rightly.

26:09.760 --> 26:10.960
Now that time allows,

26:11.040 --> 26:13.480
it's best to indulge in elegance.

26:13.560 --> 26:14.440
Regarding today's matter,

26:14.520 --> 26:17.400
I'll leave it to Hepu local authorities
to handle.

26:18.320 --> 26:20.480
-Special Envoy Xu, this matter--
-Master Shijiu,

26:20.560 --> 26:23.160
the court won't wrong a good person,

26:23.240 --> 26:25.600
nor will it spare a bad one.

26:26.920 --> 26:28.880
Don't let a mere pearl diver

26:28.960 --> 26:30.200
ruin your important affairs.

26:32.920 --> 26:33.800
Yes.

26:35.240 --> 26:36.080
Special Envoy Xu,

26:36.600 --> 26:40.160
the Pearl Poetry Gathering
is about to begin. This way, please.

26:41.000 --> 26:44.240
-Junior Brother, please.
-Senior Brother, please.

27:00.840 --> 27:02.080
This way, please.

27:02.160 --> 27:04.520
-Much appreciated.
-She can't stand the sight of you, right?

27:05.440 --> 27:06.880
Then I'll make sure
she sees plenty of you.

27:09.080 --> 27:10.320
Come with me to the gathering.

27:16.000 --> 27:18.400
-Are you alright from earlier?
-I'm fine.

27:18.480 --> 27:21.440
-Duanwu, are you alright?
-You head back first.

27:31.120 --> 27:33.040
The landscapes are breathtaking,

27:33.120 --> 27:35.200
and the talents are refined.

27:35.280 --> 27:36.840
Today, the Yan convoy

27:36.920 --> 27:40.480
warmly welcomes scholars from all over
to gather in Guangzhou…

27:40.560 --> 27:41.560
RADIANT WORDS PAINT SILKEN SCENES
DEPTH PROFOUND, LIKE PEARLS' GLEAMS

27:41.640 --> 27:43.680
…exchanging ideas through poetry
and celebrating the art.

27:43.760 --> 27:47.080
Your presence, esteemed scholars,
graces the South Sea,

27:47.160 --> 27:49.240
a true joy for all.

27:49.320 --> 27:52.360
Gentlemen in the audience,
feel free to bring your words to life

27:52.440 --> 27:55.480
on paper and join this grand event.

27:56.160 --> 27:57.080
Everyone,

27:59.440 --> 28:01.240
-forgive my humble effort!
-I'll go!

28:02.160 --> 28:04.680
-Me too!
-I'll go!

28:08.280 --> 28:11.920
Now, all scholars, please compose a poem.

28:14.120 --> 28:17.400
COMPOSING A POEM…

28:23.320 --> 28:26.880
Mr. Zhang, we meet again.
What a fateful encounter!

28:26.960 --> 28:29.400
My encounter with Master Yan
might have been planned.

28:30.720 --> 28:33.800
But I do have a question
I'd like to ask you.

28:34.320 --> 28:37.280
After this Pearl Poetry Gathering,
let's have a chat.

28:37.360 --> 28:39.760
With Mr. Zhang's invitation,
how could I decline?

28:41.280 --> 28:44.160
With an old friend to meet,
a familiar face to see,

28:44.240 --> 28:45.440
but I arrived a step too late.

28:45.520 --> 28:47.360
I might have missed some fun.

28:48.120 --> 28:50.440
Mr. Zhang, you truly are a charming poet.

28:50.520 --> 28:53.280
Everyone, old and new, seeks
to share their thoughts with you.

28:54.240 --> 28:58.160
But today, with pearls as the theme,
I host this Pearl Poetry Gathering.

28:58.240 --> 29:00.360
I hope Mr. Zhang
will compose a masterpiece

29:00.440 --> 29:01.920
that will be remembered for ages.

29:02.800 --> 29:04.440
I won't disappoint Master Yan.

29:17.120 --> 29:20.160
Mr. Jiang from Yangzhou offers a poem.

29:24.680 --> 29:27.480
"A single star of wisdom
lights eight regions wide

29:27.560 --> 29:30.440
Five-colored clouds grace
the jade-bright autumn sky

29:30.520 --> 29:33.480
Surely Heaven pities
the lone scholar's plight

29:33.560 --> 29:36.920
Yet holds back pure light
from my tower at night"

29:37.000 --> 29:39.040
This is a poem
by Mr. Jiang from Yangzhou.

29:39.640 --> 29:41.360
It's a poem
expressing his unrecognized talent.

29:41.440 --> 29:42.920
Isn't it a bit outdated?

29:43.000 --> 29:44.880
Indeed!

29:46.440 --> 29:49.000
"I once sought the laurels
of top scholar fame

29:49.080 --> 29:51.840
To gaze from the heavens
upon Penglai's domain

29:51.920 --> 29:54.280
Now, having claimed the peak
in life's grand race

29:54.360 --> 29:58.080
I finally believe
there's a tranquil place"

29:58.160 --> 29:59.800
This is from Mr. Liu from Lianzhou.

30:00.400 --> 30:02.320
It's utterly dull, nothing special at all!

30:02.400 --> 30:03.840
A merchant hosting a poetry gathering

30:03.920 --> 30:05.680
is like an outsider in the field.

30:06.480 --> 30:07.840
Perhaps they invited the wrong crowd?

30:08.360 --> 30:10.560
"Jade blooms
and gem-like petals both delight

30:10.640 --> 30:13.560
Who says spring's hand
lacks thoughtful design?

30:13.640 --> 30:16.040
It's not that the East Lord
has no hidden plan

30:16.120 --> 30:18.760
He opens peach and plum
to grace the land"

30:18.840 --> 30:21.200
This is from Mr. Min from Fengzhou.

30:21.800 --> 30:22.920
It's just a filler poem,

30:23.000 --> 30:24.360
hardly worthy of a grand stage.

30:24.880 --> 30:27.640
When will Special Envoy Xu's poem be read?

30:27.720 --> 30:28.960
Yes, when?

30:29.040 --> 30:31.240
Let us witness the Special Envoy's grace!

30:31.320 --> 30:33.080
When will it be recited?

30:37.240 --> 30:40.240
Surely, everyone has heard
of Special Envoy Xu.

30:40.320 --> 30:44.120
Today he's here to exchange poems with us.

30:49.320 --> 30:52.400
"Jade-like purity
with golden sands aglow

30:52.480 --> 30:55.520
A fragrant snow descends
light as night's breath

30:56.080 --> 30:58.760
If not for treasures
born of this quiet place

30:58.840 --> 31:02.080
How could it gain a name
known to the world?"

31:02.160 --> 31:04.240
A fine poem indeed!

31:07.000 --> 31:09.040
Special Envoy Xu's work is unparalleled.

31:09.120 --> 31:11.720
Others could only mimic poorly.

31:11.800 --> 31:13.680
Master Shijiu, you're flattering me.

31:13.760 --> 31:16.200
I've long heard
of Special Envoy Xu's poetic talent,

31:16.720 --> 31:18.880
and seeing it today,
it truly is extraordinary.

31:18.960 --> 31:20.880
Master Yan, you're overpraising me.

31:20.960 --> 31:23.360
Senior Brother, such talent!

31:24.680 --> 31:27.400
Junior Brother, I've also heard
that you have a flair for poetry.

31:27.920 --> 31:29.960
Today, will the scholars of Guangzhou

31:30.040 --> 31:34.320
be fortunate enough
to witness your talent?

31:38.800 --> 31:40.240
Then, I won't hold back.

31:48.160 --> 31:50.040
Today is the Pearl Poetry Gathering.

31:50.680 --> 31:52.560
Naturally, the theme is pearls.

31:52.640 --> 31:55.160
People only see the beauty of pearls,

31:56.880 --> 31:58.440
but they don't know the pain behind them.

32:00.120 --> 32:02.080
When I first traveled to Hepu,

32:02.160 --> 32:03.640
a pearl diver told me her story.

32:04.960 --> 32:07.040
Behind them
lies a tale of blood and tears,

32:07.120 --> 32:08.440
sorrowful beyond words.

32:13.680 --> 32:15.800
Pearl divers dive deep into the sea.

32:17.160 --> 32:18.440
The icy cold pierces their bones.

32:19.400 --> 32:20.760
They pry open shells for pearls,

32:21.640 --> 32:23.680
and to evade the man-eating sharks,

32:24.640 --> 32:27.680
they leap from the water like mermaids.

32:33.640 --> 32:35.080
I'll title this poem,

32:37.280 --> 32:38.960
"Tears of the Mermaid".

32:42.400 --> 32:44.800
Mr. Zhang, you're a poet.

32:44.880 --> 32:46.440
When you have a moment,

32:47.120 --> 32:50.440
could you write a poem on pearl diving

32:50.960 --> 32:53.720
and let the world know the hardship of it?

32:53.800 --> 32:56.360
Alright, I'll put my all into it

32:57.400 --> 32:58.680
to write a worthy poem.

33:03.880 --> 33:05.880
In the South Sea, the mermaids dwell

33:06.800 --> 33:09.240
Riding waves through depths so clear.

33:10.480 --> 33:12.400
Their tears turn to pearls that swell

33:13.760 --> 33:16.280
While the Dragon's Palace
unveils the frost

33:18.800 --> 33:20.600
The mermaids drift with the tide's flow

33:21.640 --> 33:23.680
Endlessly bound to toil below

33:23.760 --> 33:26.280
-I can't do this anymore…
-Get down there!

33:32.560 --> 33:34.200
At the ocean's floor
they seek mother shells

33:36.560 --> 33:38.600
Sacred clams endure
the iron's cold edge

33:43.920 --> 33:45.800
In the furious sea
as fierce winds swell

33:47.560 --> 33:50.240
Their strength wanes
under the burdens they dredge

33:51.400 --> 33:52.840
These are my pearls!

33:53.480 --> 33:55.080
-I gathered them!
-Hurry, go!

33:55.760 --> 33:56.600
Go!

33:57.240 --> 33:59.320
One tear of a mermaid
so rare and bright

34:04.000 --> 34:06.120
Is bought with the blood
of countless divers

34:20.719 --> 34:22.280
A magnificent poem indeed,

34:22.800 --> 34:24.320
grand and vigorous,

34:24.400 --> 34:25.719
full of life and vitality!

34:26.239 --> 34:28.040
This is a true outcry against injustice,

34:28.120 --> 34:30.080
a model for us scholars!

34:30.159 --> 34:32.600
Bravo!

34:32.679 --> 34:34.040
A fine poem!

34:34.760 --> 34:36.639
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

34:36.719 --> 34:37.639
A fine poem!

34:37.719 --> 34:40.560
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

34:40.639 --> 34:42.600
A fine poem! A fine poem!

34:42.679 --> 34:45.280
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

34:45.360 --> 34:47.440
It seems the top honor
of this Pearl Poetry Gathering

34:47.520 --> 34:48.800
must go to Mr. Zhang.

34:48.880 --> 34:52.480
Junior Brother,
you're truly a peerless talent.

34:52.560 --> 34:53.480
With this poem,

34:53.560 --> 34:56.199
I must admit, mine pales in comparison.

34:58.600 --> 34:59.960
Senior Brother, you're flattering me.

35:01.360 --> 35:04.720
Actually, those last two lines
weren't mine.

35:06.080 --> 35:07.520
If that's so,

35:07.600 --> 35:12.080
then is Mr. Zhang's title
as top poet undeserved?

35:14.040 --> 35:16.320
People know only the value
of the mermaid's tears,

35:18.520 --> 35:19.960
but they don't realize behind them

35:20.880 --> 35:22.480
is the blood and flesh
of countless pearl divers.

35:23.640 --> 35:25.480
People only want to witness its beauty,

35:26.560 --> 35:28.520
yet ignore the bloodshed
of the pearl divers.

35:30.400 --> 35:32.240
That pearl diver once told me,

35:33.640 --> 35:35.040
One tear of a mermaid
so rare and bright

35:35.560 --> 35:37.440
Is bought with the blood
of countless lives

35:37.520 --> 35:39.080
Those last two lines

35:40.560 --> 35:41.640
came from her own lips.

35:47.280 --> 35:49.920
Mr. Zhang, your honesty is unmatched.

35:50.000 --> 35:52.960
This poem, "Tears of the Mermaid",
will surely echo across the land!

35:53.040 --> 35:55.200
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

35:56.240 --> 35:57.520
Bravo!

36:00.640 --> 36:01.680
Bravo!

36:03.520 --> 36:05.560
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

36:07.560 --> 36:09.120
A fine poem!

36:11.960 --> 36:15.240
A fine poem!

36:15.840 --> 36:18.240
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

36:22.120 --> 36:23.560
A fine poem!

36:29.480 --> 36:31.720
What's the point
of seizing that pearl diver?

36:32.720 --> 36:34.400
Even if she paid with her life,

36:34.480 --> 36:36.320
would it solve our immediate problem?

36:36.400 --> 36:39.200
Do you know that Zhang Jinran
is Prince Ying's sworn brother?

36:39.280 --> 36:41.600
Our words today
will certainly have alerted him.

36:41.680 --> 36:44.520
The situation in Guangzhou
won't stay calm.

36:44.600 --> 36:47.440
Remember from now on,
you must act with caution.

36:48.360 --> 36:49.480
Thank you, Special Envoy Xu,
for the guidance.

36:50.000 --> 36:52.560
But the fire at the pearl farm
must be linked to the Yan family.

36:52.640 --> 36:55.120
Proving this could resolve
the Cui family's crisis.

36:55.200 --> 36:56.880
Special Envoy Xu,
please, you must help us--

36:56.960 --> 37:00.360
Expedite matters
concerning the tribute pearls.

37:10.480 --> 37:12.240
You traveled such a long way

37:12.760 --> 37:14.120
just to see me, didn't you?

37:14.200 --> 37:16.040
Master Yan, you really know how to joke.

37:16.560 --> 37:17.880
You're no refined lady,

37:18.440 --> 37:19.920
so who's trying to court you?

37:21.000 --> 37:23.640
But Duanwu is clever and resilient,

37:24.160 --> 37:25.760
yet she's suffered quite a bit.

37:25.840 --> 37:27.520
She doesn't know the dangers outside,

37:28.080 --> 37:29.600
and she's still inexperienced.

37:30.120 --> 37:33.040
So, I hope you'll treat her well.

37:33.640 --> 37:35.520
There are so many suffering people
in this world.

37:36.120 --> 37:37.680
Can you care for them all?

37:38.280 --> 37:39.720
Duanwu is a servant on my ship.

37:40.320 --> 37:42.040
No need for you to worry about her.

37:43.760 --> 37:46.080
Our acquaintance is all because of pearls.

37:47.320 --> 37:49.520
You bought out all of Cui's pearls
in one go,

37:50.040 --> 37:51.000
quite a big move.

37:52.040 --> 37:54.320
But you do realize tribute pearls
can't be traded privately?

37:55.160 --> 37:57.400
Whether they're tribute pearls
is Cui's business.

37:57.920 --> 38:01.440
I'm just a merchant.
I only know that payment is settled,

38:01.520 --> 38:02.360
and we owe each other nothing.

38:02.440 --> 38:03.920
Why get involved in all this trouble?

38:04.000 --> 38:05.720
Well, naturally, it's profitable.

38:05.800 --> 38:06.680
Nothing more?

38:10.120 --> 38:11.760
But I did hear a tale.

38:12.880 --> 38:16.760
The Pearl Tower was originally built,
not by the Cui family

38:17.840 --> 38:19.400
but by the Yan family.

38:23.400 --> 38:24.880
I've heard a bit of that too.

38:25.640 --> 38:29.720
I heard that the Yan family of Yangzhou
was wiped out.

38:30.480 --> 38:31.720
No one survived.

38:32.440 --> 38:34.280
Where were you
when the Pearl Tower was set ablaze?

38:41.800 --> 38:44.440
On my merchant ship, heading to Guangzhou.

38:44.520 --> 38:46.720
And when you arrived in Guangzhou,
Cui Ding ended up dead by the sea.

38:46.800 --> 38:48.600
-Why?
-He deserved it.

38:48.680 --> 38:49.560
His evil knew no bounds.

38:49.640 --> 38:52.040
Before Cui Ding died,
he was clearly beaten,

38:52.560 --> 38:53.720
and his death was brutal.

38:53.800 --> 38:56.920
He was a vicious criminal,
unworthy of sympathy.

38:57.000 --> 38:59.080
But someone told me

39:00.240 --> 39:01.440
Cui Ding boarded your ship.

39:06.200 --> 39:07.480
Now that's peculiar.

39:08.800 --> 39:10.600
Cui Shijiu put out a bounty.

39:11.120 --> 39:14.400
If someone saw him,
why not claim the reward?

39:16.840 --> 39:18.960
The Mirage
was originally a Hepu merchant ship.

39:20.560 --> 39:22.320
After Cui Ding boarded,

39:23.000 --> 39:24.920
it flew your Yan family's flag.

39:26.200 --> 39:28.080
I find this quite puzzling.

39:30.240 --> 39:31.360
My surname is Yan.

39:34.720 --> 39:38.280
-Look at me. I forgot about that.
-So…

39:39.240 --> 39:41.240
I actually ran
into an old acquaintance that day.

39:42.080 --> 39:42.960
She can confirm for me.

39:45.120 --> 39:46.280
Kang Ju.

39:59.480 --> 40:01.360
Duanwu, let me ask you.

40:01.440 --> 40:03.680
The day after the Pearl Tower burned,

40:04.200 --> 40:05.760
did you board my merchant ship?

40:07.360 --> 40:08.440
Yes.

40:10.520 --> 40:12.120
And were you with me?

40:14.160 --> 40:16.200
-Yes.
-And did you…

40:16.920 --> 40:18.640
see Cui Ding?

40:33.760 --> 40:35.600
I'm asking you to tell Mr. Zhang.

40:36.480 --> 40:37.880
On that day, were you with me?

40:39.360 --> 40:41.000
And did you see Cui Ding?

40:50.280 --> 40:51.720
No, I did not see Cui Ding.

41:03.480 --> 41:04.320
Duanwu.

41:14.680 --> 41:15.720
Duanwu,

41:15.800 --> 41:18.840
do you realize aiding a murderer
is a serious crime?

41:27.080 --> 41:28.000
Master Yan,

41:28.720 --> 41:30.520
some things you should know yourself.

41:31.520 --> 41:32.360
No proof is needed.

41:33.560 --> 41:34.400
The Cui's Pearl Farm

41:34.480 --> 41:36.280
has shorted the annual tribute pearls
to the court,

41:36.360 --> 41:38.560
and now, these pearls
are in your possession.

41:39.600 --> 41:41.400
You can't possibly claim innocence.

41:42.360 --> 41:43.840
I'll be keeping a close watch on you.

42:15.000 --> 42:17.200
What's the matter? Regretting it?

42:17.720 --> 42:19.640
Regretting you didn't leave
with Mr. Zhang?

42:21.560 --> 42:24.480
After all, he's the son
of the Minister of Personnel.

42:25.000 --> 42:25.880
Even if you became his concubine,

42:25.960 --> 42:29.520
I believe you'd live a life
of luxury and wealth.

42:34.120 --> 42:35.240
What is it?

42:36.720 --> 42:37.840
Is it because of the blood-stained pearls

42:38.360 --> 42:39.240
or something else?

42:39.320 --> 42:42.120
Just now, I lied for you,
clearing your suspicion.

42:44.320 --> 42:45.440
What reward do you have for me?

42:45.520 --> 42:47.560
You did give false testimony for me,

42:48.520 --> 42:51.120
but as for Mr. Zhang,
he no longer trusts you.

42:51.200 --> 42:52.560
He won't listen to you anymore.

42:53.160 --> 42:55.720
Before you bargain with me,
consider carefully

42:55.800 --> 42:58.040
what value you hold
and what leverage you have.

42:58.120 --> 42:59.560
I have no leverage.

43:01.120 --> 43:02.800
I'm merely a slave.
